2630..2705 Comment "/// Put-get, put-put and get-get together, the laws a state-passing handler"
2706..2782 Comment "/// is checked against (`../specification/state-wp.gandr`). A read of a read"
2783..2861 Comment "/// under a store is a redex of put-get and of get-get, and both reducts store"
2862..2939 Comment "/// the value and continue at it twice. Get-put beside them is refused in the"
2940..2957 Comment "/// twin (#1934)."
